      "content": "it's just hard to find a reason to \"reconnect\" when there's nothing left to connect to. my friends are gone, my health is failing, and most days it feels like i'm just a burden to the doctors and the people checking in on me. it feels more like i'm just lingering than actually living. it would be so much more dignified if i could just decide when the curtain closes, instead of this slow, messy decay.",
